# Project Context

Retail analytics platform: POS batch + inventory/clickstream streams → Iceberg
Bronze/Silver → Redshift Gold via dbt; Airflow/MWAA; local Docker/DuckDB on a
dedicated branch.

## Branches (do not mix)

| Branch | Role |
|---|---|
| `main` | Fully cloud-deployed path (MSK, EMR, Redshift, MWAA). |
| `local-testing-version` | Local Docker/Flink/DuckDB testing only. |

Do not merge local-only compose/bind-mount/venv wiring into `main`. Cherry-pick
shared cloud logic (dbt, Flink jobs, DAGs, contracts) only when asked.

## Source of Truth

`ARCHITECTURE.md`, `README.md`, `docs/ENVIRONMENTS.md`, `docs/decisions/ADR-*.md`,
`docs/data-model/`, `docs/runbooks/`.

## Stack (pinned in repo)

- Python ≥3.10 (local `.venv` via `uv sync --group dev`); Flink image Python 3.10.
- Flink **1.17.1** (EMR 6.15.0 parity); Iceberg Bronze/Silver; dbt Core **1.11.***; Terraform **1.6+**.
- Kafka topics: `inventory.events.v1`, `clickstream.events.v1` + DLQs. POS is **batch Parquet** → S3 Bronze (no POS Kafka topic).
- Flink jobs: `inventory_bronze_job`, `clickstream_bronze_job`, `inventory_silver_job`, `iceberg_maintenance` (Airflow-owned batch maintenance).
- Terraform: `bootstrap` + `platform`; dev/prod share code, differ by `envs/*`. EMR sizing is parameterized (`emr_*` vars) for low-cost dev.

## Architecture Constraints

- Iceberg Bronze/Silver on S3; Redshift Gold + serving views.
- Kimball facts/dims; surrogate int keys; SCD2 **only** on `dim_product`.
- No fact-to-fact joins (drill-across); gate PII with `marketing_consent`.
- Contract changes bump `schema_version`; POS lands Parquet to Bronze (no CSV staging).

## Operating Rules

- Cloud: `scripts/cloud/run_cloud_stack.ps1` (wrapper) → `run_terraform.ps1`, `deploy_platform.ps1` — never raw `terraform` in a stack dir.
- Cloud E2E at minimal cost: `docs/runbooks/dev-cloud-test-run.md` (MWAA/dashboard off, laptop-driven dbt/GE, destroy checklist).
- Local: `scripts/local/run_local_stack.ps1` (uses `.venv`). Compose under `infra/docker/compose/`.
- Default local dbt `-DbtSource iceberg`: Flink Parquet in `.local/iceberg` + POS `--output-dir`; seed only `dim_date`/`dim_store`. Use `-DbtSource seeds` for CSV identity fixtures.
- Kafka host: `127.0.0.1:9092`; Flink UI: `http://localhost:8082`. Start **Flink before simulate** (`latest-offset`).
- Prefer runbooks; complete files only; no secrets/placeholders/TODOs in commits.
